---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Testimonials from '../components/Testimonials.astro';
import Highlight from '../components/Highlight.astro';
import { TUTORING_HOURLY_PRICE } from '../data/pricing';

const CALENDLY_URL = 'https://calendly.com/eric-wolpert-learnsatmath/1-on-1-session-on-demand';
const COACHING_URL = 'https://calendly.com/eric-wolpert-learnsatmath/coaching-call';

const JUMPSTART_STRIPE_URL = 'https://buy.stripe.com/aFa3co5v8d7daWY5HI6wE1r';
const STANDARD_STRIPE_URL = 'https://buy.stripe.com/8x23coaPs3wD1mo9XY6wE1G';
const INTENSIVE_STRIPE_URL = 'https://buy.stripe.com/28E4gs9Loffl4yA2vw6wE1H';

// Deadline by which all sessions in a purchased plan must be used.
const SESSION_DEADLINE = 'September 30, 2026';

// Sample week of assignments shown in "The plan" section.
const planTasks = [
  { task: 'Bedrock 100 Q29–56', time: '2h', done: true },
  { task: 'Full-length practice test', time: '90m', done: true },
  { task: 'Quadratics Masterclass', time: '90m', done: false },
];

// Score trajectory shown under the checklist. Bar measures progress from the
// starting score toward the goal.
const planScore = { start: 580, current: 640, goal: 700 };
const planScorePct = Math.round(
  ((planScore.current - planScore.start) / (planScore.goal - planScore.start)) * 100
);

---

<Layout
  title="1-on-1 Tutoring"
  description="Private SAT math tutoring with Eric. Personalized instruction, flexible scheduling, and proven results. Book a session directly."
>

  <!-- Warm up connections to Calendly so the booking popup opens faster -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://calendly.com" crossorigin />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://assets.calendly.com" crossorigin />

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-ink-mid text-white py-12 lg:py-16 hero-section">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[10fr_11fr] gap-12 items-center">

        <!-- Left: text -->
        <div>
          <h1 class="font-sans font-black text-4xl lg:text-6xl tracking-tight mb-3">1-on-1 Coaching</h1>
          <p class="font-sans font-extrabold text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-chalk/80 mb-6">
            Focused entirely on <Highlight>you</Highlight>
          </p>
          <p class="text-chalk/80 text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed font-semibold mb-6">
            Personalized instruction with the sole focus of getting you to your goal score.
          </p>
          <a
            href="#pricing"
            class="inline-block bg-coral text-white font-black px-10 py-4 rounded-full border-2 border-ink shadow-[3px_3px_0_0_rgba(247,246,242,0.4)] hover:shadow-none hover:translate-x-[3px] hover:translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-200 text-base tracking-wide"
          >
            Book a Session
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Right: video -->
        <div>
          <video
            src="/tutoring_sizzle.mp4"
            autoplay
            loop
            muted
            playsinline
            class="w-full rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-md"
          ></video>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Coaching selling point -->
  <section class="py-12 lg:py-16 bg-sky">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 2xl:px-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight mb-4">Know <Highlight>exactly</Highlight> how to study</h2>
          <p class="text-ink/80 font-semibold text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Most test prep treats every student the same. My coaching starts with your current score, your goal, and your schedule, and then builds a custom roadmap to close the gap.
          </p>
          <br>
          <p class="text-ink/80 font-semibold text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Every 1-on-1 session is laser-focused on your weakest concepts and problems. And every assignment is calibrated to your schedule. 
          </p>
          <br>
          <p class="text-ink/80 font-semibold text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Of course, schedules and progress are not always predictable! After each session, we'll look back on the plan and revise as needed.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div id="plan-card" class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-md p-5 sm:p-6">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
            <h3 class="font-sans font-extrabold text-xl text-ink">This week's plan</h3>
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/50 whitespace-nowrap">Week 3 of 8</span>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            {planTasks.map((t) => (
              <div class="plan-row bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm p-4 flex items-center gap-4">
                {t.done ? (
                  <span class="plan-check w-8 h-8 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#23A55A] flex items-center justify-center">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-white" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                      <path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                ) : (
                  <span class="plan-check w-8 h-8 shrink-0 rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-ink/40"></span>
                )}
                <span class="flex-1 font-bold text-ink text-base sm:text-lg">{t.task}</span>
                <span class="shrink-0 text-xs font-black px-2.5 py-1 border-2 border-ink rounded-full bg-chalk whitespace-nowrap">{t.time}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 pt-5 border-t-2 border-ink/10">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 mb-1">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/50">Projected score</p>
              <span
                id="plan-score-chip"
                class="text-xs font-black px-2.5 py-0.5 border-2 border-ink rounded-full bg-mint whitespace-nowrap"
              >
                +{planScore.current - planScore.start} pts
              </span>
            </div>
            <p
              id="plan-score-value"
              class="font-sans text-3xl font-black text-ink mb-2"
              data-from={planScore.start}
              data-to={planScore.current}
            >
              {planScore.current}
            </p>
            <div class="h-6 border-2 border-ink rounded-full bg-white shadow-offset-sm overflow-hidden">
              <div
                id="plan-score-bar"
                class="h-full rounded-full bg-[#23A55A]"
                style={`width: ${planScorePct}%`}
                data-width={`${planScorePct}%`}
              ></div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between mt-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-ink/40">
              <span>Started at {planScore.start}</span>
              <span>Goal {planScore.goal}</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Testimonials -->
  <section class="py-12 lg:py-16 bg-mint">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight mb-2">From students</h2>
      </div>
      <Testimonials filter="other" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Pricing -->
  <section id="pricing" class="py-12 lg:py-16 bg-peach">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight">Choose your plan</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch">

        <!-- Jumpstart Card -->
        <div data-price-card class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink p-8 flex flex-col shadow-offset-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200">
          <div class="mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 bg-sky">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-ink" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/50 mb-1">For the self-driven student</p>
                <h3 class="font-sans text-2xl text-ink font-bold">Jumpstart</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="font-sans text-4xl font-black text-ink">$695</span>
              <span class="relative text-ink/40 text-lg font-bold" data-slash-price>
                $1,115
                <span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[2px] w-full bg-coral" data-slash></span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 flex-1 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-ink">2 hours of 1-on-1 sessions with Eric</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>Personalized roadmap with every single assignment between now and test day</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>15 hours of SAT Math Masterclass recordings</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>Lifetime access to Bedrock Pro; includes 127 video lessons</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-ink"><span class="bg-electric px-1.5 -ml-1.5">For self-driven students who need a plan</span></span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href={JUMPSTART_STRIPE_URL}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="block text-center bg-coral text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm hover:shadow-none hover:translate-x-[3px] hover:translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-200"
          >
            Get Started
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Standard Card (highlighted) -->
        <div data-price-card class="animated-border-wrapper-electric rounded-2xl relative hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200 shadow-[5px_5px_0_0_#FFE135]">
          <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2">
            <span class="bg-electric text-ink text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border-2 border-ink whitespace-nowrap">
              Most popular
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-[14px] p-8 flex flex-col h-full">
            <div class="mb-6 mt-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 bg-electric">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-ink" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 6.75V15m6-6v8.25m.503 3.498l4.875-2.437c.381-.19.622-.58.622-1.006V4.82c0-.836-.88-1.38-1.628-1.006l-3.869 1.934c-.317.159-.69.159-1.006 0L9.503 3.252a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.006 0L3.622 5.689C3.24 5.88 3 6.27 3 6.695V19.18c0 .836.88 1.38 1.628 1.006l3.869-1.934c.317-.159.69-.159 1.006 0l4.994 2.497c.317.158.69.158 1.006 0z" />
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/50 mb-1">For most students</p>
                  <h3 class="font-sans text-2xl text-ink font-bold">Standard</h3>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
                <span class="font-sans text-4xl font-black text-ink">$1,895</span>
                <span class="relative text-ink/40 text-lg font-bold" data-slash-price>
                  $2,255
                  <span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[2px] w-full bg-coral" data-slash></span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 flex-1 mb-8">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
                <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-ink">6 hours of 1-on-1 sessions with Eric</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
                <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span>Personalized roadmap with every single assignment between now and test day</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
                <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span>15 hours of SAT Math Masterclass recordings</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
                <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span>Lifetime access to Bedrock Pro; includes 127 video lessons</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
                <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span>Add hours anytime at $250/hr</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
                <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
                <span class="font-bold text-ink"><span class="bg-electric px-1.5 -ml-1.5">For a 100+ point improvement</span></span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <a
              href={COACHING_URL}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              data-calendly
              class="block text-center bg-coral text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm hover:shadow-none hover:translate-x-[3px] hover:translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-200"
            >
              Book a free call
            </a>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink/60 text-center mt-3">
              or <a href={STANDARD_STRIPE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-coral underline hover:no-underline">skip the call and enroll now</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Intensive Card -->
        <div data-price-card class="bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink p-8 flex flex-col shadow-offset-md hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-200">
          <div class="mb-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 bg-coral">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-6 h-6 text-ink" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 18L9 11.25l4.306 4.307a11.95 11.95 0 015.814-5.519l2.74-1.22m0 0l-5.94-2.28m5.94 2.28l-2.28 5.941" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/50 mb-1">For big score jumps</p>
                <h3 class="font-sans text-2xl text-ink font-bold">Intensive</h3>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="font-sans text-4xl font-black text-ink">$3,095</span>
              <span class="relative text-ink/40 text-lg font-bold" data-slash-price>
                $3,965
                <span class="absolute left-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-[2px] w-full bg-coral" data-slash></span>
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-3 flex-1 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-ink">12 hours of 1-on-1 sessions with Eric</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>Personalized roadmap with every single assignment between now and test day</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>15 hours of SAT Math Masterclass recordings</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>Lifetime access to Bedrock Pro; includes 127 video lessons</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span>Add hours anytime at $225/hr</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-base text-ink/80">
              <span class="text-coral font-black mt-0.5">✓</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-ink"><span class="bg-electric px-1.5 -ml-1.5">For a 150+ point improvement</span></span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href={COACHING_URL}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            data-calendly
            class="block text-center bg-coral text-white font-bold py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm hover:shadow-none hover:translate-x-[3px] hover:translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-200"
          >
            Book a free call
          </a>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink/60 text-center mt-3">
            or <a href={INTENSIVE_STRIPE_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-coral underline hover:no-underline">skip the call and enroll now</a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- On-Demand banner -->
      <div class="mt-10 bg-white rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-md p-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:gap-6">
        <p class="text-ink font-bold text-lg text-center">Just need an hour? Book an on-demand session for ${TUTORING_HOURLY_PRICE}/hr</p>
        <a
          href={CALENDLY_URL}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          data-calendly
          class="block text-center bg-white text-ink font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full border-2 border-ink shadow-offset-sm hover:shadow-none hover:translate-x-[3px] hover:translate-y-[3px] transition-all duration-200 whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Book a Session
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
<section class="py-12 lg:py-16 bg-chalk">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-10">
      <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold text-ink tracking-tight">Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3" id="faq-list">

      <div class="faq-item border-2 border-ink rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-offset-sm overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-left gap-4">
          <span class="font-sans font-bold text-lg text-ink">Should I join the masterclass or do 1-on-1 tutoring?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-ink transition-transform duration-300" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-body max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-in-out">
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 space-y-3 text-ink/80 font-semibold leading-relaxed">
            <p>If your SAT is less than 2 weeks away → Buy the Jumpstart Plan to prep intensively.</p>
            <p>If a live Masterclass cohort is starting soon (or has just started) and you're scoring above a 600 → Join the live Masterclass.</p>
            <p>If neither of the above cases are true, and you're willing to commit time, effort, and money to improve your score, then pick the coaching package that fits your goal — or book a free call and we'll figure out the right one together.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border-2 border-ink rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-offset-sm overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-left gap-4">
          <span class="font-sans font-bold text-lg text-ink">What do you assign between sessions?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-ink transition-transform duration-300" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-body max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-in-out">
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 space-y-3 text-ink/80 font-semibold leading-relaxed">
            <p>With personalized coaching, you'll be provided a concrete list of tasks between each session.</p>
            <p>These include:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1">
              <li>SAT Math Masterclass recordings, covering the concepts and problems in-depth</li>
              <li>Bluebook tests with specific score range targets for each test</li>
              <li>Focus areas – Tasks assigned based on your weaknesses from the last session.</li>
              <li>130+ of my own proprietary practice problems</li>
            </ul>
            <p>The custom plan schedules tasks based on their expected duration to complete, keeping you on track with your expected weekly prep hours for your goal score.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item border-2 border-ink rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-offset-sm overflow-hidden">
        <button class="faq-trigger w-full flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-5 text-left gap-4">
          <span class="font-sans font-bold text-lg text-ink">How do I schedule these sessions?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 text-ink transition-transform duration-300" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
            <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-body max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-[max-height] duration-300 ease-in-out">
